{
  "description": "The supersession gate runs inside the commit, after the event insert and with both rows locked: a replacement that does not exist or lies in another scope is ReplacementNotAllowed with no status, an ineligible one with its status, and so is superseding a record that is not there. The store applies no transition table, so a record can be moved back to Validated at the store; superseding its replacement by it then closes a cycle, refused with the replacement's (eligible) status. Retrying the committed supersession replays it after its replacement moved on.",
